DESCRIPTION:Don’t miss the chance to see UK sensation Michael McIntyre tr
 y out new material in an intimate setting in NYC.Michael McIntyre is one of
  the world’s most successful comedians. His tours have sold over 4 millio
 n tickets\, including a record-breaking 33 sold out shows at London’s O2 
 arena for which he was awarded the keys to the venue. Michael’s global su
 ccess continues to flourish with his latest show “Macnificent”\, tourin
 g the world including Norway\, Denmark\, Belgium\, Netherlands\, Finland\, 
 Gibraltar\, South Africa\, Australia\, New Zealand\, Singapore\, Malta\, UA
 E\, Ireland\, UK\, Canada and USA. In addition to stand-up\, Michael hosts 
 two of the BBC’s most successful entertainment shows\, “Michael McIntyr
 e’s Big Show” and Michael Mcintyre’s “The Wheel”. The BAFTA and N
 ational Television Award winning “Big Show” is currently in its eighth 
 series and averages over seven million viewers and “The Wheel”\, which 
 Michael also devised is in its fifth series and has been nominated for both
  BAFTA and National Television Awards.\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/
